    "title": "One-term city councilwoman hoping to become the next mayor of Idaho Falls - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Rett Nelson, EastIdahoNews.com ,\n10 hours ago IDAHO FALLS – After four years on the Idaho Falls City Council, Lisa Burtenshaw is hoping to become the city’s next mayor. The 51-year-old woman is one of three candidates vying for the position currently occupied by Mayor Rebecca Casper, who has announced she will not be seeking re-election for a fourth term. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
